From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:30:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: Contacts follows the system Dark theme

Contacts now looks like Phone and every other Sable app: light while the
system Dark theme is off, dark while it is on, instead of dark whatever
the setting.

* sable_colors.xml holds the light Sable palette (the same values as
  Phone); the dark palette from 0755 moves unchanged to values-night.
  Every 0755 colour resource already points at these tokens. Two faint
  white overlays (selected navigation item, disabled button) become
  tokens with a black light-theme copy.
* The framework-themed styles (PeopleTheme, the dialog, selectable item
  and background themes, the list view) inherit SableMaterial* styles
  that are Theme.Material.Light* by day and Theme.Material* at night;
  the AppCompat themes and the toolbar overlay inherit DayNight.
* Status and navigation bar icons are dark on the light palette
  (sable_light_bars).

No Java change; no behaviour change.
